KEYSTROKES:
# Whole-year print for 2026 ("Key MM.YYYY, press A" for balance of year, per
# the User Instructions above — starting at month 1 (January) prints the
# whole year). Data entry (keying MM.YYYY) is left at regular speed and
# outside the elapsed-time measurement; pressing A both stores the value and
# starts the print, so it's the last thing before switching to full speed.
82              # 1
93              # .
83              # 2
92              # 0
83              # 2
74              # 6
ZeroElapseTime
FullSpeed:
11              # A — store MM.YYYY and print balance of year
RegularSpeed:
ReportElapseTime
